# Project

- Implement directly; inspect code first; run tests after significant changes; fix failures autonomously.
- Ask confirmation only for ambiguous product decisions. Commit only when requested.
- Never commit secrets. Spotify secret stays server-side.
- Bun + Biome. EF migrations for schema changes. Regenerate `packages/api-client`, do not edit it.
- API prefix `/api/v1`. Clean Architecture tests must pass.
